        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As AI is rapidly becoming a general-purpose technology, we are well positioned to service customers from large enterprises, established software vendors, scaled AI companies and startups to research labs and individual developers building the next generation of AI models, applications and services.",
        "start_character": 4428,
        "end_character": 4727
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-052948",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-052948-4e1793bf79a63af1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-052948",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer flexible working arrangements, including remote working options, as well as mental health support services.",
        "start_character": 35758,
        "end_character": 35874
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-052948",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-052948-4e1793bf79a63af1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-052948",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Alongside building AI cloud that delivers maximum performance per watt, we prioritize supporting the communities where we operate through a growing set of initiatives across education partnerships, training programs and access to compute resources for academia and research.",
        "start_character": 36393,
        "end_character": 36667
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-052948",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-052948-4e1793bf79a63af1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-052948",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For this reason, we build our infrastructure from the ground up, designing servers and racks in-house and embedding innovation in the design of our data centers resulting in optimization of compute performance.",
        "start_character": 5199,
        "end_character": 5409
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-052948",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-052948-4e1793bf79a63af1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-052948",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to our core AI cloud and other businesses, we own equity stakes in both ClickHouse and Toloka, two businesses that were both created and developed by our in-house engineering teams and spun out from the group.",
        "start_character": 30959,
        "end_character": 31180
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-052948",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-052948-4e1793bf79a63af1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-052948",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our approach also extends to the communities where we operate.",
        "start_character": 40419,
        "end_character": 40481
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-052948",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-052948-4e1793bf79a63af1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-052948",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our preferred method of acquired capacity is through greenfield data centers, though we remain opportunistic with co-locations as this offers faster time-to-market capacity.",
        "start_character": 9421,
        "end_character": 9594
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-052948",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-052948-4e1793bf79a63af1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-052948",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The majority of this capacity will be deployed from data centers that we own and design internally.",
        "start_character": 6590,
        "end_character": 6689
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-052948",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-052948-4e1793bf79a63af1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-052948",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "These programs are complemented by initiatives we are developing to expand access to AI resources, including cloud grants and compute access for academic and research institutions.",
        "start_character": 40238,
        "end_character": 40418
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-052948",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-052948-4e1793bf79a63af1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-052948",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Through Nebius Academy, our AI education platform for researchers and engineers, we provide training, certifications and academic partnerships designed to equip participants with practical skills in data science, machine learning and generative AI.",
        "start_character": 39989,
        "end_character": 40237
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-052948",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-052948-4e1793bf79a63af1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-052948",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also hold a significant equity stake in Toloka, a leading data provider for LLM and GenAI developers, which was spun off from the group in May 2025.",
        "start_character": 31354,
        "end_character": 31505
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-052948",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-052948-4e1793bf79a63af1",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-052948",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We build our infrastructure from the ground up, designing servers and racks in-house, embedding innovation in the design of our data centers and developing software for workload orchestration and optimization.",
